      propertyPath: m_text
      value: 'As you hold the <i>controller orb</i> inside the <i>central orb</i>,
        the screen will slowly fade to black.


        Continue holding the controller
        still until the screen fades back in.

        Otherwise, the trial will
        restart.


        Try this now - hold the <i>controller orb</i> inside the
        <i>central orb</i>.'
